# No environment variables are required to develop, build, or test this
# repo by default:
#   - apps/marketing uses SQLite + a seed script — needs nothing.
#   - packages/core and packages/ui tests need nothing.
#
# The only env vars in this monorepo are MySQL/Postgres connection strings
# for the Drizzle adapter's *integration* tests (not run by default). See
# packages/adapters/drizzle/.env.example.
